  "_about": "iX Cluster's Ribbon, adapted from Cluster Themes' Ribbon: calm and premium. One ribbon of light under the top edge fills with battery power on a labelled display scale (cool white warming to amber; eDrive blue while recuperating), with a dot and a number at every step. The speed sits in the middle in big thin numbers with the selector in a small frame above it. Power, battery temperature and charge on the left; drive mode, electric range and average speed this drive on the right. Holiday editions as Cluster Themes'.",
